I expected that the moduleName returned is not undefined but the moduleName of the source file.

My end goal here is that I want to know in which module the expression that I am using is defined in that case the Jasmine `it`. 

**Actual behavior:**
When I run checker.ts The filename is resolved and the moduleName is always undefined.

